{"seq":3,"slug":"ideas-and-methods","title":"庄子·ideas-and-methods","stage":"DONE","category":"zhuangzi","categoryLabel":"庄子","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/25_zhuangzi/3_ideas-and-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"庄子-思想与方法\">庄子·思想与方法</h1><p>庄子的思想与方法，构成了中国道家最深邃、最自由的智慧。本 hub 聚焦庄子哲学的<strong>核心观念与方法本身</strong>，沿三条主线展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>逍遥游</strong>——追求&quot;无待&quot;的、绝对的精神自由，是庄子思想的灵魂与目标（<a href=\"free-and-easy-wandering/absolute-freedom\">逍遥游</a>、<a href=\"free-and-easy-wandering/the-useless-and-the-great\">无用之用</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>齐物论</strong>——齐同万物、超越是非、道通为一，是通往逍遥的认识论根基（<a href=\"equality-of-things/the-equality-of-all-things\">齐物论</a>、<a href=\"equality-of-things/the-butterfly-dream\">庄周梦蝶</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>顺应自然</strong>——道法自然、养生、旷达生死，是其形上根基与人生实践（<a href=\"following-nature/the-dao-and-spontaneity\">道与自然</a>、<a href=\"following-nature/nourishing-life\">养生与齐生死</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>庄子专题共六个 hub，各有分工，避免重复展开同一内容：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>庄周其人、隐者选择、战国背景</td>\n<td>史实/生平，本 hub 不展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>《庄子》文本、深化道家、新视角</td>\n<td>贡献的总体定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>思想与方法（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>逍遥/齐物/顺应自然的观念与方法</strong></td>\n<td><strong>思想内容本身</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n<td>内七篇、寓言、语言与悖论</td>\n<td>文本结构/文学手法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>塑造中国文化、禅宗、当代价值</td>\n<td>后世影响，本 hub 仅点到</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>作者真伪、思想争论、总体评价</td>\n<td>学术争议的系统讨论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：<strong>本 hub 讲&quot;庄子想了什么、怎么想&quot;</strong>；文本如何组织见 <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>，思想从何而来、传向何处见 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 与 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[前置: 老子·道法自然] --&gt; A[道与自然 · 形上根基]&#10;  A --&gt; B[齐物论 · 认识论根基]&#10;  B --&gt; C[逍遥游 · 自由目标]&#10;  C --&gt; D[无用之用 · 价值反题]&#10;  B --&gt; E[庄周梦蝶 · 齐物的形象化]&#10;  A --&gt; F[养生与齐生死 · 人生实践]&#10;  C --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  P[前置: 老子·道法自然] --&gt; A[道与自然 · 形上根基]\n  A --&gt; B[齐物论 · 认识论根基]\n  B --&gt; C[逍遥游 · 自由目标]\n  C --&gt; D[无用之用 · 价值反题]\n  B --&gt; E[庄周梦蝶 · 齐物的形象化]\n  A --&gt; F[养生与齐生死 · 人生实践]\n  C --&gt; F</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置知识</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../../laozi/ideas-and-methods/dao-follows-nature/the-way-of-nature\">老子·道法自然</a>。庄子继承老子的&quot;道&quot;&quot;自然&quot;&quot;无为&quot;，理解老庄渊源后再读庄子，事半功倍。</li>\n<li><strong>入门顺序</strong>：若想从根基读起，按 道与自然 → 齐物论 → 逍遥游 的顺序（本体 → 认识 → 目标）；若想从最著名意象切入，可从 <a href=\"free-and-easy-wandering/absolute-freedom\">逍遥游</a> 或 <a href=\"equality-of-things/the-butterfly-dream\">庄周梦蝶</a> 起步。</li>\n<li><strong>延伸对照</strong>：庄子的&quot;齐物&quot;&quot;超越是非&quot;可与儒家入世取向对照（<a href=\"../../confucius/ideas-and-methods/\">孔子</a>）；其旷达精神深刻影响了后世文人（<a href=\"../../su-shi/ideas-and-methods/\">苏轼·思想与方法</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每篇文档均给出原文出处、关键概念辨析、常见误读与现代意义，并以相对链接互相串联，同一事实只在主篇展开、他篇以链接引用。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"free-and-easy-wandering","title":"Free And Easy Wandering","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/free-and-easy-wandering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"absolute-freedom","title":"逍遥游","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/free-and-easy-wandering/absolute-freedom"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-useless-and-the-great","title":"无用之用","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/free-and-easy-wandering/the-useless-and-the-great"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"equality-of-things","title":"Equality Of Things","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/equality-of-things","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-equality-of-all-things","title":"齐物论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/equality-of-things/the-equality-of-all-things"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-butterfly-dream","title":"庄周梦蝶","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/equality-of-things/the-butterfly-dream"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"following-nature","title":"Following Nature","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/following-nature","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-dao-and-spontaneity","title":"道与自然","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/following-nature/the-dao-and-spontaneity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nourishing-life","title":"养生与齐生死","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/following-nature/nourishing-life"}]}]}